# mgterm.msg - Moriarty's terminal (mgterm.ssl). One entry per line; no braces in comments.

# 100 to 102: look, examine, Repair.
{100}{}{You see a terminal built out of three other terminals.}
{101}{}{A screen, a keyboard with two keys missing, and a box of relays that ticks while it thinks. Somebody has dusted it. Nothing else in this room has been dusted.}
{102}{}{It is not broken. It is merely old, and unwilling.}

{150}{}{You mark a walled city far to the east on your map: Vault City.}

